\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b \cf0 Week 3 \'97 Friction early-warning
\f0\b0 \
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\partightenfactor0
\ls3\ilvl0\cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Micro-experiment: Once a week, proactively ask a direct report or peer, "Is there anything unresolved between us I should know about?"\
\ls3\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Reflection question: What signals of discomfort did I notice this week and defer? What made me defer them?\
