\pard\pardeftab720\sa298\partightenfactor0

\f1\b\fs36 \cf0 5. Short scripts\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\fs24 \cf0 Seeking feedback:
\f0\b0  "I'm working on being more transparent and better at sharing credit. Can you tell me about a specific moment recently where I could have done either better?"\

\f1\b Pausing before a reactive decision:
\f0\b0  "I want to give this the thought it deserves \'97 can I get back to you by [specific time] rather than deciding right now?"\

\f1\b Giving credit:
\f0\b0  "Before I go further \'97 this direction came from [name]'s work on [specific thing], and I want that on the record."\

\f1\b Repairing harm:
\f0\b0  "I've been thinking about [specific incident]. I don't think I handled it well, and I want to understand your side before I explain mine."\

\f1\b Responding ethically to conflict:
\f0\b0  "I notice we see this differently. Before we go further, can we both name what we're actually trying to protect here?"\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa298\partightenfactor0

