\pard\pardeftab720\sa298\partightenfactor0

\f1\b\fs36 \cf0 7. Final reminder\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f0\b0\fs24 \cf0 Self-assessment questionnaires like this are useful for reflection, not diagnosis \'97 they measure self-reported tendencies, not fixed traits, and your scores can shift with context, mood, and the specific wording of items. Treat this as a starting conversation with yourself, not a verdict. If you share any of this with colleagues, be mindful that their experiences of you are their own valid data too \'97 and their privacy and dignity matter as much as your own growth process, especially if any of these reflections involve specific people or incidents.\
